# web-console — Archived Change

**Archived**: 2026-07-06
**Change**: web-console — Phase 1 async job runner + minimal web API + minimal UI
**Status**: ✅ COMPLETE — All PRs (PR1, PR2, PR3) merged to release/0.3.x

## Archive Contents

This folder contains the complete SDD lifecycle artifacts for the web-console change:

- `proposal.md` — SDD proposal with all architectural decisions
- `exploration.md` — Pre-exploration of RQ+Redis vs SQLite hybrid
- `design.md` — Detailed architecture and ADRs
- `tasks.md` — Implementation task breakdown (all 70 tasks complete)
- `apply-progress.md` — PR execution tracking (PR1 foundation, PR2 web, PR3 docs)
- `verify-report.md` — SDD verification reports for all PRs
- `specs/` — Delta spec files (promoted to main specs)

